(:id "port/lua/fixed/scalar-bounds" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/luatable/fixed_evolution_proof_test.go: TestLuaFixedEvolutionScalarBounds") :tested-revision "4d4e5723a2257bb4b0769438eb503a91424ca6ac" :note "2026-11-07: ported from moo's TestMooFixedEvolution rows to the one read (docs/plans/strict-only.md): a ranged int32, int128 and uint16 each refuse out_of_range below and above, alone and together, and read in range; a compressed float rides as its float32 bits, refuses past either end, a -0 lands as +0, and a finer or dropped resolution reads the old bits unchanged (the digest carries Q); the negative control drops the signed bound. Run on macOS arm64 with the pinned Lua 5.4.8 (make dist-lua), SCHEMA_SLOW=1, at this revision.")
